e and receives no SpecificDisease label. Exclude determiners, ordinals, and descriptive adjectives (e.g., \"the,\" \"seventh,\" \"complete,\" \"heterozygous\") from the disease span, since they are Modifier material or unlabeled text.\n  - **Does NOT apply when:**\n    - the *of*-phrase is an integral part of a recognized lexicalized disease name (e.g., a fixed \"[head] of [site or entity]\" name such as \"syndrome of inappropriate ... secretion\"). In that case, the full name is the span.\n    - the state noun is not followed by an *of*-argument. Bare compounds and named diseases (e.g., \"Coats disease\") are unaffected.\n    - the state phrase is a non-disease descriptive use in the gold standard (e.g., \"results in a deficiency of norrin\"). Such phrases must not receive a SpecificDisease label.\n    - the gold span already covers the full \"X of Y\" construction. Then the error is not at the boundary, so verify the gold span before trimming.", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 1846, "output_tokens": 4318, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 3714}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}